{"seq":1,"slug":"product-management","title":"产品经理入门","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":6,"docCount":24,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management","rating":{"composite":4.15,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.98,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4.75}},"introMarkdown":"# 产品管理 简介\n\n产品管理是软件工程师最值得拓展的跨领域能力之一。在日常开发中，工程师往往专注于\"如何实现\"，而产品管理关注的是\"为什么要做\"和\"做什么最有价值\"。理解产品管理的思维方式和方法论，能够帮助工程师在技术决策中融入用户视角，在团队协作中更有效地与产品经理对话，甚至在职业发展中打开通往技术负责人或创业者的道路。\n\n本手册面向希望系统学习产品管理知识的程序员和技术人员。你不需要转行做产品经理，但掌握产品思维会让你成为更有全局观的工程师。无论你是前端、后端、全栈还是移动端开发者，这些知识都将为你提供从用户价值出发思考问题的能力。\n\n通过本手册，你将学到如何从工程思维转向产品思维，如何理解用户的真实需求而非表面诉求，如何将模糊的想法转化为清晰的需求文档，以及如何用数据而非直觉来驱动产品决策。这些能力将帮助你在评审会上提出更有建设性的意见，在技术方案选型时做出更贴近业务价值的判断。\n\n建议的学习路径是按照章节顺序推进。第一章\"产品思维\"是整个手册的认知基础，帮助你建立从用户价值出发的思考框架，理解产品心态、价值主张、生命周期和指标体系。这是后续所有章节的思维底座。\n\n第二章\"用户研究\"教你如何真正了解用户。通过访谈方法、用户画像、旅程地图和 JTBD 框架，你将掌握从用户身上提取洞察的系统方法，而非凭空猜测用户需要什么。\n\n第三章\"需求分析\"将用户洞察转化为可执行的开发需求。从需求收集、用户故事编写、验收标准定义到需求优先级排序，这是连接产品侧和技术侧的关键桥梁，也是工程师在日常工作中接触最多的产品管理环节。\n\n第四章\"PRD 写作\"聚焦于产品需求文档的撰写。PRD 是产品经理与工程团队沟通的核心载体，理解 PRD 的结构、功能规格说明、UX 文案写作和评审流程，能让你更准确地理解需求意图，也能在必要时自己撰写高质量的需求文档。\n\n第五章\"路线图与优先级\"帮助你理解产品规划的全貌。通过路线图框架、RICE 评分法、MoSCoW 方法和 OKR 对齐，你将学会如何在有限资源下做出最优的产品决策，这对于技术负责人和架构师尤为重要。\n\n第六章\"数据驱动决策\"是产品管理的量化支撑。A/B 测试、漏斗分析、队列分析和产品分析工具的运用，将帮助你用数据验证假设、衡量效果，避免凭感觉做产品决策。对于注重严谨性的工程师而言，这一章的方法论会格外亲切。\n\n六个章节从认知到实践、从定性到定量，构成一个完整的产品管理知识体系。掌握这些知识，你将不再只是一个执行需求的开发者，而是能够参与产品决策、理解商业逻辑、用技术创造用户价值的全面型工程师。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"product-thinking","title":"产品思维","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/product-thinking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"product-mindset","title":"产品心态","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/product-thinking/product-mindset"},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-value-proposition","title":"用户价值主张","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/product-thinking/user-value-proposition"},{"seq":3,"slug":"product-lifecycle","title":"产品生命周期","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/product-thinking/product-lifecycle"},{"seq":4,"slug":"product-metrics","title":"产品指标体系","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/product-thinking/product-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-research","title":"用户研究","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/user-research","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"user-interview-methods","title":"用户访谈方法","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/user-research/user-interview-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"persona-creation","title":"用户画像创建","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/user-research/persona-creation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"journey-mapping","title":"用户旅程地图","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/user-research/journey-mapping"},{"seq":4,"slug":"jobs-to-be-done","title":"JTBD 框架","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/user-research/jobs-to-be-done"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"requirement-analysis","title":"需求分析","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/requirement-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"requirement-gathering","title":"需求收集","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/requirement-analysis/requirement-gathering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-stories","title":"用户故事","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/requirement-analysis/user-stories"},{"seq":3,"slug":"acceptance-criteria","title":"验收标准","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/requirement-analysis/acceptance-criteria"},{"seq":4,"slug":"requirement-prioritization","title":"需求优先级","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/requirement-analysis/requirement-prioritization"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"prd-writing","title":"PRD 写作","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/prd-writing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prd-template","title":"PRD 结构","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/prd-writing/prd-template"},{"seq":2,"slug":"feature-specification","title":"功能规格说明","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/prd-writing/feature-specification"},{"seq":3,"slug":"wireframe-basics","title":"UX 文案写作","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/prd-writing/wireframe-basics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"stakeholder-review","title":"PRD 评审流程","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/prd-writing/stakeholder-review"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"roadmap-prioritization","title":"路线图与优先级","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/roadmap-prioritization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"roadmap-frameworks","title":"路线图框架","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/roadmap-prioritization/roadmap-frameworks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rice-scoring","title":"RICE 评分法","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/roadmap-prioritization/rice-scoring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"moscow-method","title":"MoSCoW 方法","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/roadmap-prioritization/moscow-method"},{"seq":4,"slug":"okr-alignment","title":"OKR 对齐","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/roadmap-prioritization/okr-alignment"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"data-driven-decisions","title":"数据驱动决策","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/data-driven-decisions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ab-testing-fundamentals","title":"A/B 测试基础","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/data-driven-decisions/ab-testing-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"funnel-analysis","title":"漏斗分析","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/data-driven-decisions/funnel-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cohort-analysis","title":"队列分析","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/data-driven-decisions/cohort-analysis"},{"seq":4,"slug":"product-analytics-tools","title":"产品分析工具","url":"/h/cross-discipline/product-management/data-driven-decisions/product-analytics-tools"}]}]}